questions.stem:
Đoạn code sau in ra gì?
```js
for (var i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
  setTimeout(() => console.log(i), 0);
}
```

answer_key.reference_solution:
function debounce(fn, wait) {
  let timer = null;
  return function (...args) {
    clearTimeout(timer);
    timer = setTimeout(() => fn.apply(this, args), wait);
  };
}

